    "analysis": "Compare conservative native and static counter extrema; bound the slow/fast ratio of predictions using nonnegative weights. Exclude all-zero features from the ratio. If the denominator can be zero with a positive numerator, no finite upper ratio follows from that feature. Report individual feature spans and the resulting error lower bound, including a zero bound if the pair no longer excludes a fit."
